*** select_sort.pgm — Epiora v1.1 Task 3 reference program.
*** SELECT: repeated SELECTs AND-combine; missing values in comparisons
*** (MASHEDPOTA has one missing cell in Oswego12); CANCEL SELECT.
*** SORT: ascending, DESCENDING, multi-key, sort order of missing
*** (TIMESUPPER is missing in 47 of 75 rows); CANCEL SORT.
*** Pins spec §15.2: missing values in comparisons, sort order of missing.
READ '@WORK_DIR@/Sample.mdb':Oswego12
ROUTEOUT "@OUTPUT_HTML@" REPLACE
FREQ MASHEDPOTA
SELECT MASHEDPOTA = 1
FREQ MASHEDPOTA
CANCEL SELECT
SELECT MASHEDPOTA <> 1
FREQ MASHEDPOTA
CANCEL SELECT
SELECT MASHEDPOTA = (.)
FREQ MASHEDPOTA
CANCEL SELECT
SELECT ILL = 1
FREQ ILL
SELECT AGE > 40
LIST AGE ILL MASHEDPOTA
CANCEL SELECT
SORT AGE
LIST AGE SEX
SORT AGE DESCENDING
LIST AGE SEX
SORT SEX AGE
LIST SEX AGE
SORT TIMESUPPER
LIST TIMESUPPER AGE
CANCEL SORT
LIST AGE SEX
CLOSEOUT
QUIT
